  "releaseNotes": "Siticone UI - Key Improvements:\n\nIMPORTANT - PLEASE READ BEFORE UPDATING:\n• Back up your existing projects before updating.\n• Read the changelog below carefully before updating your library version.\n• Contact Siticone support before updating if you have questions or need clarification.\n• Test the new version in a separate test project before applying it to a production project.\n\nIMPROVEMENTS:\nWe have enhanced and updated the following controls. We added new features and fine-tuned their rendering, performance, speed, resource usage, etc:\n\n1. Siticone Button\n2. Siticone Textbox\n3. Siticone Left Sidebar",
